    "For miners that do not report their block themselves (NerdOS, AxeOS before 2.13). MinerGuru briefly connects from this Mac to the miner's pool, logs in with the miner's address and the worker name “minerguru”, reads the first job and disconnects. You then see block height, reward, fees and recipients, and whether your address is among them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für Miner, die ihren Block nicht selbst melden (NerdOS, AxeOS vor 2.13). MinerGuru verbindet sich dazu vom Mac aus kurz mit dem Pool des Miners, meldet sich mit dessen Adresse und dem Worker-Namen „minerguru“ an, liest den ersten Auftrag und trennt wieder. So siehst du Blockhöhe, Belohnung, Gebühren und Empfänger und ob deine Adresse dabei ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For miners that do not report their block themselves (NerdOS, AxeOS before 2.13). MinerGuru briefly connects from this Mac to the miner's pool, logs in with the miner's address and the worker name “minerguru”, reads the first job and disconnects. You then see block height, reward, fees and recipients, and whether your address is among them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
