    "No schedules yet. A schedule puts miners into night mode or pauses them during a tariff zone or at set times; afterwards they return to their own settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noch keine Zeitpläne. Ein Zeitplan schaltet Miner während einer Tarifzone oder zu festen Uhrzeiten in den Nachtmodus oder pausiert sie; danach kehren sie zu ihren eigenen Einstellungen zurück."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No schedules yet. A schedule puts miners into night mode or pauses them during a tariff zone or at set times; afterwards they return to their own settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No shares are submitted; on 17 tested solo pools no extra worker appeared. It only asks while a miner's detail page is open, at most every 5 minutes per pool. The pool sees your connection's IP address, just as it does for your miner." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es werden keine Shares eingereicht; bei 17 getesteten Solo-Pools erschien kein zusätzlicher Worker. Abgefragt wird nur bei offener Detailseite, höchstens alle 5 Minuten je Pool. Der Pool sieht die IP-Adresse deines Anschlusses, wie beim Miner auch."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No shares are submitted; on 17 tested solo pools no extra worker appeared. It only asks while a miner's detail page is open, at most every 5 minutes per pool. The pool sees your connection's IP address, just as it does for your miner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
